<p class="tc-body tc-rv">TRE™ is a body-led series of simple, powerful exercises to release stress, tension and trauma. It safely activates the body’s natural reflex of shaking or vibrating — calming the nervous system and releasing muscular tension. When this process occurs in a safe and controlled environment, the body naturally returns to a balanced state.</p>
<p class="tc-kicker tc-rv">Reported benefits of regular TRE™ practice:</p>
<ul class="tc-bgrid" data-tc-stagger="70">
<li class="tc-rv"><div class="tc-ben" data-tc-spot=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-bicon"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span>Deeper and more restful sleep</span></div></li>
<li class="tc-rv"><div class="tc-ben" data-tc-spot=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-bicon"><i class="fa-solid fa-battery-full"/></span><span>Increased personal energy for work and home</span></div></li>
<li class="tc-rv"><div class="tc-ben" data-tc-spot=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-bicon"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"/></span><span>Increased focus, concentration and clearer thinking</span></div></li>
<li class="tc-rv"><div class="tc-ben" data-tc-spot=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-bicon"><i class="fa-solid fa-spa"/></span><span>Greater calm and emotional composure in stressful situations</span></div></li>
<li class="tc-rv"><div class="tc-ben" data-tc-spot=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-bicon"><i class="fa-solid fa-cloud-sun"/></span><span>Less worry, anxiety and depression</span></div></li>
<li class="tc-rv"><div class="tc-ben" data-tc-spot=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-bicon"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking"/></span><span>Relief from stress-related physical pain, with increased flexibility and mobility</span></div></li>
</ul>
<p class="tc-note tc-rv">Learn more about TRE™ worldwide at <a class="tc-link-inline" href="https://treglobal.org/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">treglobal.org</a></p>
