</section><section class="section-sage tc-sec tc-why">
<div class="tc-wrap">
<header class="tc-head tc-rv">
<span class="tc-eyebrow">About TRE™</span>
<h2 class="tc-h2">Why TRE™ Is Worth Certifying In</h2>
</header>
<div class="tc-why-ui tc-rv" data-tc-tabs="">
<div class="tc-why-stage">
<div class="tc-why-grid">
<article class="tc-wp">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="tc-wp-i"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask"/></div>
<h3>Evidence-Based</h3>
<p>TRE™ is backed by over 40 years of research and clinical application across 100+ countries. It has been used with PTSD, trauma, chronic stress and general wellness populations.</p>
</article>
<article class="tc-wp">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="tc-wp-i"><i class="fa-solid fa-chalkboard-user"/></div>
<h3>Teachable</h3>
<p>Unlike many modalities, TRE™ can be taught to clients for independent practice — making it a high-value, scalable addition to any practitioner’s toolkit.</p>
</article>
<article class="tc-wp">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="tc-wp-i"><i class="fa-solid fa-brain"/></div>
<h3>Physiologically Grounded</h3>
<p>Works directly with the nervous system through the body’s natural tremor mechanism. No need to narrate or revisit traumatic content.</p>
</article>
<article class="tc-wp">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="tc-wp-i"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-spin"/></div>
<h3>Versatile</h3>
<p>Applicable in 1:1 coaching, group facilitation, corporate wellness, trauma support, athletic recovery, personal development and more.</p>
</article>
<article class="tc-wp">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="tc-wp-i"><i class="fa-solid fa-globe"/></div>
<h3>Globally Recognised</h3>
<p>TRE™ certification is internationally recognised through TRE™ for All. Certified Providers join a global network of practitioners.</p>
</article>
<article class="tc-wp">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="tc-wp-i"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"/></div>
<h3>Fast to See Results</h3>
<p>Clients typically experience tangible shifts within 3–4 sessions. The return on investment — for practitioners and clients — is unusually fast.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="section-white tc-sec tc-how">
<div class="tc-wrap">
<header class="tc-head tc-rv">
<span class="tc-eyebrow">The Certification Path</span>
<h2 class="tc-h2">How the Certification Works</h2>
<p class="tc-sub">Three modules — each a 2-day workshop plus 4 online sessions — take you from personal practice to Certified Global TRE™ Provider.</p>
</header>
<div class="tc-path tc-rv" data-tc-steps="">
<div class="tc-steps">
<div class="tc-st" data-tc-short="Module 1">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-st-num">1</span>
<div>
<h3>Module 1 — Your Personal TRE™ Practice</h3>
<p>2-day workshop + 4 online personal TRE™ sessions. Explore the stress response (anatomy, neurology and physiology), understand the therapeutic tremor response, and experience TRE™ as a self-practice — including self-regulation, containment and grounding strategies. The first step for anyone keen to pursue the certification path.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="tc-st" data-tc-short="Module 2">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-st-num">2</span>
<div>
<h3>Module 2 — Teaching TRE™ to One Person</h3>
<p>2-day workshop + 4 online supervision sessions. Open to those who have completed Module 1 and their personal TRE™ sessions. Deepens Module 1 content, covers Polyvagal theory and basic TRE™ interventions, with hands-on practice teaching TRE™ one-to-one.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="tc-st" data-tc-short="Module 3">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-st-num">3</span>
<div>
<h3>Module 3 — Teaching TRE™ to Groups</h3>
<p>2-day workshop + 4 online supervision sessions. Open to those who have completed all learning requirements from Module 2. Deepens Module 2 content and covers the role of fascia, advanced TRE™ interventions and modifications, transference and counter-transference, and experience leading groups of 3+ persons.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="tc-st" data-tc-short="Certified">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="tc-st-num">4</span>
<div>
<h3>Global TRE™ Certified Provider</h3>
<p>On completing all three modules you receive your Global TRE™ Provider certificate — qualified to offer TRE™ to the general public in both individual and group settings, and to competently guide clients through the TRE™ process.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
